<title>UK: World Bank sets 2.0 billion Lux franc bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets 2.0 billion Lux franc bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Generale Luxembourg, Banque et Caisse d'Epargne de l'Etat and and Generale Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN LUF   COUPON     5.50	MATURITY    17.SEP.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.15    PAY DATE    17.SEP.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    =	   YIELD	 5.22</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 50-250    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
